        "t": "h1",
        "html": "Riya and Friends - A kids storybook",
        "text": "Riya and Friends - A kids storybook",
        "indent": 0,
        "x": 408,
        "w": 904,
        "size": 40
      },
      {
        "t": "metaValue",
        "html": "In a world of magic and friendship, three best friends stumble upon a genie with the power to grant three wishes. But every wish comes with a twist. Join Riya, Pingu, and Bubbles on an adventure as they navigate the tricky world of magical wishes, outsmart the cunning genie, and ultimately discover the true meaning of friendship. Riya and Friends is storybook aimed to help children learn about greed, teamwork and friendship. I had the hand of a talented artist, Phelis, and the ideas of the project owner, Prince Safri as collaboration on this work.",
        "text": "In a world of magic and friendship, three best friends stumble upon a genie with the power to grant three wishes. But every wish comes with a twist. Join Riya, Pingu, and Bubbles on an adventure as they navigate the tricky world of magical wishes, outsmart the cunning genie, and ultimately discover the true meaning of friendship. Riya and Friends is storybook aimed to help children learn about greed, teamwork and friendship. I had the hand of a talented artist, Phelis, and the ideas of the project owner, Prince Safri as collaboration on this work.",
