        {
          "t": "h3",
          "html": "The story of Riya, Pingu, and Bubbles and their encounter with the cunning genie provides an engaging and valuable lesson for children. Through their journey, children can learn about the consequences of greed, the importance of teamwork, and the true meaning of friendship. The story highlights the pitfalls of making selfish wishes and the importance of thinking carefully before making decisions. It also emphasizes the power of working together to overcome challenges and outsmarting tricky situations. This story was prepared to serve as a wonderful tool for teaching children about important values and life lessons in an entertaining and relatable way.",
          "text": "The story of Riya, Pingu, and Bubbles and their encounter with the cunning genie provides an engaging and valuable lesson for children. Through their journey, children can learn about the consequences of greed, the importance of teamwork, and the true meaning of friendship. The story highlights the pitfalls of making selfish wishes and the importance of thinking carefully before making decisions. It also emphasizes the power of working together to overcome challenges and outsmarting tricky situations. This story was prepared to serve as a wonderful tool for teaching children about important values and life lessons in an entertaining and relatable way.",
